                                                                Management
                                                                Sciences (SMS), Varanasi for eight years. He holds a
                                                                Ph.D.
                                                                in Management from Sambalpur University, Odisha, with
                                                                his
                                                                doctoral research focused on digital marketing
                                                                strategies
                                                                and online intention to purchase in e-commerce
                                                                ecosystems.
                                                                He is an alumnus of IIM Ahmedabad.<br>
                                                                With over a decade of experience spanning academia and
                                                                industry, Dr. Bhanja integrates applied insights with
                                                                scholarly rigor. His core teaching and research
                                                                interests
                                                                includes Marketing Management, Digital Marketing,
                                                                Integrated
                                                                Marketing Communication, Sales and Distribution
                                                                Management,
                                                                Retail Management, Consumer Behaviour, Electronic
                                                                Commerce,
                                                                Customer Relationship Management, Human Resource
                                                                Management
                                                                and Business Communication. He has published scholarly
                                                                articles in Scopus-indexed journals, ABDC-listed
                                                                journals,
                                                                and presented research at national and international
                                                                conferences, including IEEE, BITS Pilani, and Banaras
                                                                Hindu
                                                                University. Notably, he has contributed to
                                                                interdisciplinary
                                                                research on the role of AI in predictive analytics and
                                                                the
                                                                application of spirituality in leadership practices
                                                                within
                                                                corporate environments.<br>
                                                                He has participated in several Faculty Development
                                                                Programs
                                                                and Management Development Programs at premier
                                                                institutions
                                                                including IIM Ahmedabad, IIT Kharagpur, NIT Rourkela,
                                                                Sambalpur University and SMS Varanasi enhancing his
                                                                methodological expertise in SPSS, AMOS, Bibliometric
                                                                Analysis, and Statistical Modeling. He was selected to
                                                                attend the 45th Faculty Development Programme at IIM
                                                                Ahmedabad (2025).<br>
                                                                Additionally, he has contributed to curriculum
                                                                development,
                                                                academic administration, and student development through
